    "sections": {
        "description": "NXT Apostille is a modern, professional WordPress theme designed specifically for apostille, notary, legal documentation, and attestation service providers. It features a clean layout, well-structured service sections, and conversion-focused design to help build trust and generate leads. The theme is fully compatible with Elementor, allowing easy drag-and-drop customization without coding. It is responsive, SEO-friendly, and optimized for fast performance across all devices. NXT Apostille also works seamlessly with popular plugins like Contact Form 7 and WooCommerce, making it ideal for showcasing services, handling inquiries, and growing your documentation service business online."
